"possible values; \"click\" means windows must be clicked in order to focus "
"them, \"sloppy\" means windows are focused when the mouse enters the window, "
"and \"mouse\" means windows are focused when the mouse enters the window and "
"unfocused when the mouse leaves the window."
msgstr ""
"Itinuturo ng window focus mode kung paano lumalabas ang window. May 3 itong "
"posibleng values: \"Click\" - dapat i-click ang window para mag-focus sa "
"kanila, \"sloppy\" - lumilipat ang focus sa window kung pumasok dito ang "
"mouse, at \"mouse\" - lumilipat ang focus sa window kung pumasok dito ang "
"mouse pero nawawala ang focus kung umalis ang mouse sa window"

